Kyle's_Death:You are aware that Kyle died. But why is there no sign of his grave at the graveyard?:300:kyle's_grave_stone
Undead_Mystery_Part1:Every time you kill an undead animal, it always seems to reappear somewhere else. But how? You feel a sudden urge to be able to control these animals to do your own bidding, and for your own purposes.:5000:resurrection_powder
Undead_Mystery_Part2:You've found out how undead are coming back. Now figuring out how Kyle infused this powder into the undead should help you do what is required to accomplish your goal.:10000:undead_essence
Dried_Up_Past_Part1:You are aware that the city is ruined, abandoned, and no longer being maintained by anyone. Can you figure out why? Did the undead have anything to do with this, or was it something bigger?:2500:dirt_covered_newspaper
Dried_Up_Past_Part2:You've figured out that the desert west of the city actually used to be a section of the city that was burned down by a huge commotion. You begin to wonder what, or who, could've done this, and you have some slight possibilities.:4500:silver_dragon_egg
